# Golden/generated fixtures for the query-language regression corpora
# (PromQL/LogQL/TraceQL golden SQL, one testdata/golden/ tree per head).
#
# These files are produced by `just update-golden <head>` and are meant to
# be diffed byte-for-byte, never hand-merged: a merge conflict here should
# be resolved by regenerating, not merging. Marking them -merge means a
# conflicting merge fails loudly instead of silently interleaving content
# from both sides; linguist-generated keeps them out of diff summaries and
# code-review UIs.
**/testdata/golden/**/*.txtar -merge
**/testdata/golden/**/*.txtar linguist-generated=true
